<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Nexora Tweak</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background: #050505;
      color: white;
    }

    header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 25px 60px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #222;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      z-index: 1000;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #00d9ff;
    }

    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 25px;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: #00d9ff;
    }

    .hero {
      height: 90vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #111, #050505);
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 70px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 700px;
      color: #aaa;
      font-size: 20px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .buttons {
      margin-top: 35px;
    }

    .btn {
      padding: 15px 35px;
      border-radius: 15px;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: bold;
      transition: 0.3s;
      margin: 10px;
    }

    .primary {
      background: #00d9ff;
      color: black;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,217,255,0.5);
    }

    .primary:hover {
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }

    .secondary {
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid #444;
      color: white;
    }

    .secondary:hover {
      border-color: #00d9ff;
    }

    .features {
      padding: 100px 50px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .features h2 {
      font-size: 45px;
      margin-bottom: 50px;
    }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 30px;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .card {
      background: #111;
      padding: 40px;
      border-radius: 25px;
      border: 1px solid #222;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      border-color: #00d9ff;
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin: 20px 0;
      font-size: 25px;
    }

    .card p {
      color: #aaa;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px;
      border-top: 1px solid #222;
      color: #777;
    }

    @media(max-width: 700px) {
      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 45px;
      }

      header {
        padding: 20px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <div class="logo">Nexora Tweak</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="#">Ana Sayfa</a>
      <a href="#features">Özellikler</a>
      <a href="#download">İndir</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Nexora Tweak</h1>
    <p>
      FPS artır, gecikmeyi azalt ve bilgisayarını maksimum performansa ulaştır.<br>
      Oyuncular için modern tweak sistemi.
    </p>
    <div class="buttons">
      <a href="#download"><button class="btn primary">Başla</button></a>
      <a href="#features"><button class="btn secondary">Detaylar</button></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="features" id="features">
    <h2>Özellikler</h2>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>⚡ FPS Boost</h3>
        <p>Oyunlarda daha yüksek FPS ve daha akıcı deneyim.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>🛡️ Güvenli Sistem</h3>
        <p>Stabil ve optimize edilmiş modern tweak altyapısı.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>🎮 Gaming Mode</h3>
        <p>Düşük gecikme ve maksimum performans modu.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="hero" id="download" style="height:60vh;">
    <h1 style="font-size:50px;">Şimdi İndir</h1>
    <p>En güncel Nexora Tweak sürümünü indir ve farkı hisset.</p>
    <div class="buttons">
      <button class="btn primary">İndir</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Nexora Tweak. Tüm Hakları Saklıdır.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
